+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 65535 <mss 1460,sackOK,TS val ? ecr 500,nop,wscale 8>
+0.02  < P. 1:101(100) ack 1 win 1000 <nop,nop,TS val 520 ecr ?>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 101 <nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 520>
+0     accept
+0     state ESTABLISHED
+0     recv 100
+0     send 100
+0     > P. 1:101(100) ack 101 <nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 520>
